@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
hide circle
title 问答链路服务类图（整合稿）

class Frontend <<Web前端>> {
  + render(response)
}
class AskController {
  + handleAsk(request)
  + handleHealth()
}
class TaskRouter {
  + classify(question)
  + extract(text)
}
class Clarifier {
  + clarify(missingFields)
}
class AgentOrchestrator {
  + orchestrate(task)
}
class HybridRetriever {
  + retrieve(queryPlan)
}
class RRFRanker {
  + fuse(candidates)
}
class EvidenceVerifier {
  + verify(candidates)
}
class AnswerVerifier {
  + verify(draft, citations)
}
class AnswerComposer {
  + compose(checkedAnswer)
}
class LLMAdapter {
  + generate(question, evidence)
}
class 本地索引 <<Chroma + BM25>> {
  + vectorSearch(q)
  + keywordSearch(q)
}
class 外部服务 <<Qwen / Tavily>> {
  + generate()
  + search()
}

Frontend --> AskController : /api/ask
AskController --> TaskRouter : classify
AskController --> AgentOrchestrator : orchestrate
TaskRouter --> Clarifier : 信息不足时追问
AgentOrchestrator --> HybridRetriever : retrieve
HybridRetriever --> 本地索引 : 双路召回
HybridRetriever --> RRFRanker : fuse
RRFRanker --> EvidenceVerifier : verify
EvidenceVerifier --> 外部服务 : 联网核验(可选)
AgentOrchestrator --> LLMAdapter : generate
LLMAdapter --> 外部服务 : Qwen 生成
LLMAdapter --> AnswerVerifier : 草稿复核
AnswerVerifier --> AnswerComposer : compose
AnswerComposer --> AgentOrchestrator : 返回结果
AgentOrchestrator --> AskController : 响应
AskController --> Frontend : render

@enduml
